 <h3><u>Ye Fatima bhi hai Zehra bhi hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><span data-ft={ tn:k} class=userContent>yaa raaziya yaa marziya yaa tahera yaa sayyada 2<br> <br> yeh fakhre aamina sarmaayae rasool bhi hai<br> <br> yeh fatema bhi hai zahra bhi hai butool bhi hai 3<br> <br> har ek sawaal ka behtar jawaab zinda hai<br> sadaaqato ka mukammal nisaab zinda hai<br> bahaare baaghe risaalat ma aab zinda hai<br> khuda ke bando khuda ki kitab zinda hai<span class=text_exposed_show><br> bayaan azmatei khaatoone qaaenat suno<br> mubahele ki zubaan se khuda ki baat suno<br> <br> kaha jo bizato minni toh ho gaya maalum<br> dile rasul ki surat hai fatema maasum<br> kamaale ilm se aisa bana diya maqsoom<br> naseeb ho gaye 11 imamato k nuzool<br> waqaar binte nabi me na kuch kami aaye<br> khuda ke ghar mei isi waaste ali aaye<br> <br> ali ne shukr se mazdooriyo me din kaate<br> nabi ki beti ne chakki me khusk jao peese<br> ali ne baago me paani diya jihaad kiye<br> nabi ki beti ne faako me bhar diye sajde<br> jihaad nafs ka maidaa ali ke haath raha<br> kamaale sabro riza faatima k saath raha<br> <br> wo ek chota sa ghar poori kaaenat ka dil<br> woh ek hujra imamat ke noor ki manzil<br> woh baamodar jinhe sajda kare mahe kaamil<br> woh ek nakhl ke saaye me khuld ki mehfil<br> adab ke saath balandi ka har nishaan jhuke<br> jaha kaneez ke rube pe aasmaan jhuke<br> <br> banaame faatema ummat ki betiya jaage<br> nigaahe akl se raftaare zindagi dekhe<br> baraaye ghairate dil apne aap se puche<br> kise milegi jagah fatema ki mehfil me<br> khuda kare woh tamashaae rozgaar naa ho<br> rasule paak ki beti se sharmsaar na ho<br> <br> dhua tanoor se uttha to saaelo k liye<br> khameer ho gaya aata musafiro ke liye<br> sukoone qalb ka samaan bekaso k liye<br> gizaaye sabro riza apne kamsino k liye<br> isi makaam pe khairul amal ke jalwe hai<br> yahi woh har hai jaha inqilaab palte hai<br> <br> ali ke chehrae aqdas pe ambiya ka jalaal<br> wujud fatema zahra pe mustafa ka jamaal<br> ali ke dam se jaha me tajalliyo k nehal<br> mataye fatema zahra hasan husain se laal<br> ali ne masjide kufa me zakhm khaaya hai<br> zamaane waalo ne zahra ko bhi rulaaya hai</span></span></p> 
